{
 "about": "Placeholder bench rows for the fast lane (Tests/Fixtures/bench, 2026-10-20): jobs (J), agents only when asked (G3, G4), watching (G6), Spotify (S), messages, mail, notes and decks (M, N, D). {base} is the bench server URL, {host} its host:port. Rows with needs_unlocked are skipped on a locked screen. G1, G2 (Canvas) are private (a real course) and G5, G7-G9 run outside dot-bench.py.",
